#: rc.cpp:20
msgid ""
"<b>System Behavior</b><br>\n"
"Graphical User Interfaces behave differently on various Operating Systems. \n"
"KDE allows you to customize its behavior according to your needs."
msgstr ""
"<b>Stelsel Gedrag</b><br>\n"
"Grafiese Gebruiker Koppelvlakke gedra verskillend op verskeie Operating "
"Sisteme. \n"
"Kde laat toe jy na pasmaak sy Gedrag volgens na jou verlang."

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Form5"
msgstr "Vorm 5"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid ""
"<h3>Finished</H3> After closing this dialog you can always restart this "
"Wizard by choosing the entry \"Desktop Settings Wizard\" from the Settings "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"<h3>Klaar gemaak</H3> Na maak toe hierdie dialoog jy kan altyd herbegin "
"hierdie Assistent deur kies die inskrywing \"Werkskerm Instellings "
"Assistent\" van die Instellings kieslys."

#: rc.cpp:23
msgid ""
"You can refine the settings you made by starting the KDE Control Center by "
"choosing the entry \"Control Center\" in the Settings menu."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan verfyn die instellings Jy gemaak deur beginne die Kde Kontrole "
"Sentrum deur kies die inskrywing \"Kontrole Sentrum\" in die instellings "
"kieslys."

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "You can also start the KDE Control Center using the button below."
msgstr "Jy kan asook begin die Kde Kontrole Sentrum te gebruik die knoppie onder."

#: rc.cpp:25
msgid "&Launch KDE Control Center"
msgstr "Lanseer Kde Kontrole Sentrum"

