#: kpersonalizer.cpp:143
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to quit the Desktop Settings Wizard?\n"
" \t\t             The Desktop Settings Wizard helps you to configure the KDE "
"\t\t             desktop to your personal liking.\n"
" \t\t             Click 'Cancel' to return and finish your setup."
msgstr ""
"Word jy seker jy wil hê na verlaat die Werkskerm Instellings Assistent?\n"
" \t\t             die Werkskerm Instellings Assistent help jy na konfigureer "
"die Kde \t\t             Werkskerm na jou persoonlike keuse.\n"
" \t\t             Kliek 'Cancel' na terug en einde jou opstelling."

#: kpersonalizer.cpp:148
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to quit the Desktop Settings Wizard?\n"
" \t\t             If yes, click 'Quit' and all changes will be lost.\n"
" \t\t             If not, click 'Cancel' to return and finish your setup."
msgstr ""
"Word jy seker jy wil hê na verlaat die Werkskerm Instellings Assistent?\n"
" \t\t             As ja, kliek 'verlaat' en alle verander sal wees verloor.\n"
" \t\t             As nie, kliek 'Cancel' na terug en einde jou opstelling."

#: kpersonalizer.cpp:152
msgid "All changes will be lost!"
msgstr "Alle verander sal wees verloor!"

